            I live in Thiruvottiyur and use these streets regularly. During
            conversations with family and residents, I heard repeated
            concerns about drainage covers that were raised, sunken or broken.
          </p>

          <p>
            Instead of relying only on anecdotal observations, I decided to
            collect field evidence and examine where the problem appeared most
