          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div class="callout">
        <strong>Interpretation</strong>
        <p>
          Height difference provides a physical indicator of how far an
          observed cover differed from the surrounding surface. This page
          does not label any particular measurement as officially unsafe
          because no engineering threshold was part of the supplied evidence.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

